            },
            "description": "Runs one automation immediately with a test payload.\n\nDjango route:\n`POST /api/v1/automations/<automation_id>/test/`\n\nDjango view method:\n`AutomationTestAPIView.post`\n\nIn local development, send_email uses Django's console email backend, so the email is printed in the runserver terminal."
          },
          "response": []
